<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:20:42 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</link><description>由于美国股市回吐了周一大幅上涨的部分涨幅，美国国债因避险需求而上涨，这表明投资者仍对技术投资继续推动经济增长的潜力感到不安。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns'&gt;随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Advance as Stocks Fall, Reviving Haven Demand&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:42:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>量化基金减少美国国债空头押注，推动债券反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids</link><description>追逐趋势的量化基金正在削减其长期持有的美国国债空头头寸，随着股票抛售重振对政府债务的避险需求，推动了债券上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids'&gt;量化基金减少美国国债空头押注，推动债券反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Quant Funds Reduce US Treasury Short Bets, Fueling Bond Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:08:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巴西实际收益因卢拉支持更多支出限制而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</link><description>有报道称，总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦支持遏制财政支出的举措，缓解了人们对预算赤字的担忧，自他意外连任以来，预算赤字拖累了巴西雷亚尔的贬值，巴西雷亚尔创下近两个月来的最大涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs'&gt;巴西实际收益因卢拉支持更多支出限制而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Real Gains on Reports Lula Backs More Spending Curbs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:12:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于加拿大央行通胀警告，加元自八月以来涨幅最大</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/canadian-dollar-gains-most-since-august-on-boc-inflation-warning</link><description>在加拿大央行行长警告油价上涨将进一步推高消费者价格、加剧持续通胀之后，加元将迎来三个多月以来的最大涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/canadian-dollar-gains-most-since-august-on-boc-inflation-warning'&gt;由于加拿大央行通胀警告，加元自八月以来涨幅最大&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Canadian Dollar Gains Most Since August on BOC Inflation Warning&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/canadian-dollar-gains-most-since-august-on-boc-inflation-warning</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:31:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</link><description>周二，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌，芯片制造商再次大幅下跌，科技股的缓解性反弹让位于对人工智能交易持久性的新担忧。美国新关税计划也令股市承压。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally'&gt;英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Tumbles as Nvidia Euphoria Fades, New Tariffs Floated&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</link><description>据知情人士透露，Advent 正在考虑收购法国测试公司 Bureau Veritas SA，这将是今年欧洲公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas'&gt;Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Advent Weighs Takeover Of Testing Firm Bureau Veritas&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能溃败推动债券上涨，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>华尔街对人工智能交易持久性的怀疑导致科技股下跌，同时促使投资者转向安全的债券。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;人工智能溃败推动债券上涨，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Sinks as AI Rout Fuels Gains in Bonds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</link><description>由于有关油轮进一步袭击的报道掩盖了解决美伊战争的最新外交努力，油价在交投清淡中小幅走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24'&gt;11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 24&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:04:12 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>